   "segments": [
    {
     "index": 0,
     "startSeconds": 0.0,
     "endSeconds": 11.52,
     "textPreview": "嘿，各位工程师，还有未来的工程师们，欢迎回来。今天啊，咱们要解锁一个超酷的技能，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 1,
     "startSeconds": 11.52,
     "endSeconds": 20.0,
     "textPreview": "横着走的强大工具，它就叫传递函数。怎么样，准备好给你的大脑来一次大升级了吗？",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "startSeconds": 20.0,
     "endSeconds": 31.28,
     "textPreview": "行，咱们这就开始。哎，看看我们今天的游戏计划，咱们先聊聊为啥微积分这么难，得想办",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 3,
     "startSeconds": 31.28,
     "endSeconds": 40.01,
     "textPreview": "然后呢，我们会进入一个神奇的地方，叫s域。在这里学三个基本招式，学完之后就得去挑",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "startSeconds": 40.01,
     "endSeconds": 48.97,
     "textPreview": "一个怪手级的系统，最后嘛我还给你们准备了一个终极高手秘籍，是不是听着就觉得特带劲",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 5,
     "startSeconds": 48.97,
     "endSeconds": 60.01,
     "textPreview": "好，那我们先从第一点开始说，真的咱们当工程师或者学工程的，在分析那些会动的系统，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "startSeconds": 60.01,
     "endSeconds": 69.77,
     "textPreview": "呀，或者无人机啊，最头疼的是啥？没错，就是解那些该死的微分方程。你肯定有过这种经",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:90af7a0497e616bbe6249c30",
       "matchedLabel": "微分方程",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "startSeconds": 69.77,
     "endSeconds": 79.05,
     "textPreview": "就盯着屏幕上一大堆复杂的微分方程，感觉脑子都快烧了，心里就在想：天呐，肯定有更简",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:90af7a0497e616bbe6249c30",
       "matchedLabel": "微分方程",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 8,
     "startSeconds": 79.05,
     "endSeconds": 94.6,
     "textPreview": "别担心，你不是一个人，我敢说每个学工科的都这么想过。对，就是这种东西。什么高阶线",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:90af7a0497e616bbe6249c30",
       "matchedLabel": "微分方程",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 9,
     "startSeconds": 94.6,
     "endSeconds": 109.64,
     "textPreview": "但是，但是你要是想直接去解它，特别是在分析一个复杂的系统的时候，那简直就是噩梦。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 10,
     "startSeconds": 109.64,
     "endSeconds": 119.16,
     "textPreview": "那么欢迎来到我们的作弊天堂S域。在这个神奇的地方，微积分什么的我们不聊。在这里，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 11,
     "startSeconds": 119.16,
     "endSeconds": 130.52,
     "textPreview": "可以说，这就是一个能让我们的工作量瞬间减半的魔法空间。那这个魔法是怎么实现的呢？",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-9ba52fe3ff16aed315b747c8",
       "matchedLabel": "拉普拉斯变换",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 12,
     "startSeconds": 130.52,
     "endSeconds": 140.44,
     "textPreview": "你听着，你完全不需要去死磕它背后那些复杂的数学证明。你只要记住它能干嘛就行了，它",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 13,
     "startSeconds": 140.44,
     "endSeconds": 154.2,
     "textPreview": "能把那些让你头疼的微分运算，biu的一下就变成了简单的乘法。你看，在十域里求一次",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 14,
     "startSeconds": 154.2,
     "endSeconds": 167.59,
     "textPreview": "怎么样？是不是感觉世界瞬间就清爽了？好，到了四域这个新世界之后呢，每个系统或者说",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 15,
     "startSeconds": 167.59,
     "endSeconds": 179.94,
     "textPreview": "这个身份证就叫传递函数，我们一般用GS来表示。说白了，它就是系统输出除以输入，一",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 16,
     "startSeconds": 179.94,
     "endSeconds": 190.98,
     "textPreview": "这个系统是干嘛的？给他一个信号，他会怎么反应？特别直接行。既然我们已经懂了S域和",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 17,
     "startSeconds": 190.98,
     "endSeconds": 205.06,
     "textPreview": "用方框图把整个系统画出来。那接下来呢，咱们就要学简化这些图的三大基本招式。我跟你",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 18,
     "startSeconds": 205.06,
     "endSeconds": 214.5,
     "textPreview": "来，第一招：串联。你看这个图，两个方块一前一后的连着，信号先进G1出来，再进G2",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 19,
     "startSeconds": 214.5,
     "endSeconds": 225.95,
     "textPreview": "这种情况怎么办？简单到不行，直接把它们俩的传递函数乘起来就行了。总的计就等于计一",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 20,
     "startSeconds": 225.95,
     "endSeconds": 236.03,
     "textPreview": "多好好，第二招并联这种情况呢，就是两个模块同时在干活，最后把结果汇总到一块。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 21,
     "startSeconds": 236.03,
     "endSeconds": 246.67,
     "textPreview": "那总的传递函数是啥？你可能都猜到了，直接把它们俩加起来G等于G一加G二，是不是也",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 22,
     "startSeconds": 246.67,
     "endSeconds": 258.91,
     "textPreview": "OK，注意了啊，接下来是重头戏，第三招也是最最重要的一招——反馈回路。我跟你说啊",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-44e603669ad0e6bf331b1511",
       "matchedLabel": "反馈回路",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 23,
     "startSeconds": 258.91,
     "endSeconds": 271.47,
     "textPreview": "你看它把输的一部分通过一个叫H的环节，又给绕回了输入端。用来干嘛呢？用来比较，用",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 24,
     "startSeconds": 271.47,
     "endSeconds": 279.96,
     "textPreview": "这个公式大家一定要记牢了，画重点要考的，所有稳定智能的系统都靠它了。好了，理论知",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 25,
     "startSeconds": 279.96,
     "endSeconds": 288.52,
     "textPreview": "讲完了，是时候上战场了。来，咱们就用刚学的这三招去挑战一个看起来特别吓人的怪兽级",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 26,
     "startSeconds": 288.52,
     "endSeconds": 297.8,
     "textPreview": "别怕，我们的目标很简单，把这一大坨东西最后变成一个干干净净的方框。好，咱们来一步",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 27,
     "startSeconds": 297.8,
     "endSeconds": 306.28,
     "textPreview": "对付这种复杂的系统要从从里到外，先看最里面。你看到G二和H一组成的这个小圈圈了吗",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 28,
     "startSeconds": 306.28,
     "endSeconds": 317.88,
     "textPreview": "这不就是咱们的第三招——反馈回路吗？直接套公式，把它变成一个新方框。这个方框里面",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-44e603669ad0e6bf331b1511",
       "matchedLabel": "反馈回路",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 29,
     "startSeconds": 317.88,
     "endSeconds": 327.8,
     "textPreview": "搞定一个好，再看。我们刚得到的这个新方框跟它下面的G三是什么关系？哎，是并联。能",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 30,
     "startSeconds": 327.8,
     "endSeconds": 342.21,
     "textPreview": "加完之后，这个合并起来的大块儿头又跟最前面的G一是什么关系？串联。第一招直接乘。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 31,
     "startSeconds": 342.21,
     "endSeconds": 352.61,
     "textPreview": "现在整个系统是不是就变成了一个由H2构成的大号反馈回路？没错吧？那还等什么？再用",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-44e603669ad0e6bf331b1511",
       "matchedLabel": "反馈回路",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 32,
     "startSeconds": 352.61,
     "endSeconds": 364.61,
     "textPreview": "最终的答案就出来了，一个唯一的传递函数。所以你看，所谓的怪兽系统，拆开来不就是我",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-865eb1c8824e157c2f05a903",
       "matchedLabel": "传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 33,
     "startSeconds": 364.61,
     "endSeconds": 375.49,
     "textPreview": "不过说实话，要是系统再复杂一点，这么一步一步来还是挺烦的。所以接下来我给你们看看",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 34,
     "startSeconds": 375.49,
     "endSeconds": 387.27,
     "textPreview": "大家看啊，除了用方框图，我们还能用另一种方式来画这个系统，叫信号流图。你看右边这",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-9121dc2c97afa77f52ce0220",
       "matchedLabel": "信号流图",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 35,
     "startSeconds": 387.27,
     "endSeconds": 397.03,
